            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SLJ6"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Not as crunchy as I hoped. I did use no salt raw sunflower and pumpkin seeds. I also upped the flax seeds and the wheat germ to 1/4 each. Upped the cinnamon to almost a tablespoon, kinda chewy finsih....and kinda bland due to lack of salt and no sweetness...next time I would add some brown sugar and maybe 2 tblspns of olive oil. Good potential and very healthy. Tasty in my yogurt today...just not the best recipe I have tried....but thanks!",
            "datePublished": "2012-04-26T17:19:40.320Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
